---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | ChinaStyle Traditional Wear Guide"
  description="ChinaStyle privacy policy. Learn how we handle your personal data, cookies, and analytics when you visit our Chinese traditional clothing travel guide website."
  canonicalUrl="/privacy"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: "Home", url: "/" }, { name: "Privacy", url: "/privacy/" }]}>
  <section class="pt-24 pb-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#b5343a] tracking-[0.15em] uppercase">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="font-serif-sc text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-stone-900 mt-3">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-stone-500 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Last updated: August 3, 2026. This Privacy Policy describes how ChinaStyle ("we," "our," or "us") collects, uses, and shares information about you when you visit our website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="font-serif-sc text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">We do not directly collect personal information through this website. We do not have user accounts, comment sections, or newsletter sign-up forms that collect personal data.</p>

      <h2 class="font-serif-sc text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Analytics & Cookies</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">This website uses basic analytics to understand how visitors find and use our content. This may include anonymized data such as page views, referring URLs, and browser type. We do not use tracking cookies for advertising purposes. If analytics are implemented in the future, this policy will be updated accordingly.</p>

      <h2 class="font-serif-sc text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">External Links</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Our website contains links to external sites such as museums, travel services, and cultural organizations. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of these third-party sites.</p>

      <h2 class="font-serif-sc text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-10 mb-4">Contact</h2>
      <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at hello@chinesetraditionalwear.com.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
